# The two suites of the apt repository (P5-PKG-01), which scripts/apt-repo.sh
# rebuilds from the GitHub Releases at every run of apt.yml: stable holds the
# newest release, testing the newest release or pre-release (docs/apt.md).
# Each holds one version of duscope for amd64 and arm64. scripts/apt-repo.sh
# signs each Release file itself, with the subkey apt.yml imports, so no
# SignWith here.

Origin: duscope
Label: duscope
Suite: stable
Codename: stable
Architectures: amd64 arm64
Components: main
Description: duscope, the disk-usage analyzer: the newest release

Origin: duscope
Label: duscope
Suite: testing
Codename: testing
Architectures: amd64 arm64
Components: main
Description: duscope, the disk-usage analyzer: the newest release or pre-release
